WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.680
A diary that never existed,

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.070
built from records that did.

3
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.770
They read me a paper today.

4
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.250
Five years of work, in a place

5
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.610
called Fiji.

6
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.190
Everyone calls it the girmit.

7
00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.450
It is how our tongues bend the

8
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.640
word agreement.

9
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.990
Tonight we sail.

10
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.590
More than five hundred of us,

11
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.550
packed close as fish in a

12
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.240
basket, the old women say.

13
00:00:27.785 --> 00:00:30.665
The sea goes on and on.

14
00:00:30.665 --> 00:00:33.265
Sickness came aboard with us.

15
00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.225
Seventeen did not live to see

16
00:00:35.225 --> 00:00:36.235
the shore.

17
00:00:36.781 --> 00:00:39.241
Land at last, after seventy two

18
00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:42.621
days. Amma, I am writing so you

19
00:00:42.621 --> 00:00:44.231
know that we arrived.

20
00:00:44.861 --> 00:00:47.261
We sleep in long low rows they

21
00:00:47.261 --> 00:00:48.361
call lines.

22
00:00:48.361 --> 00:00:50.661
The contract is five years.

23
00:00:50.661 --> 00:00:53.341
After that, the passage home is

24
00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:55.821
ours to pay, or the government's

25
00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.051
after ten.

26
00:00:58.354 --> 00:00:59.394
For GS2 and GS1:

27
00:00:59.394 --> 00:01:01.914
over two million Indians went

28
00:01:01.914 --> 00:01:03.794
out as indentured labour.

29
00:01:03.794 --> 00:01:06.674
Mauritius received almost half a

30
00:01:06.674 --> 00:01:09.054
million, between 1834 and 1920.

31
00:01:09.054 --> 00:01:12.114
Its Aapravasi Ghat is a UNESCO

32
00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:13.044
site.

33
00:01:13.809 --> 00:01:16.429
Fourteen stone steps still stand

34
00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:17.739
in Port Louis.
